s with starting area from 672 Sq.ft to 886 Sq.ft Carpet Area at affordable cost. The project is well connected by various modes of transportation. The site is in c\n\nlose proximity to various civic utilities.\n\nMalad West is a prominent suburb in Western Mumbai. To the west of Swami Vivekanand lies Chincholi Bunder Road which connects SV and Link Road and ends at Malad Creek. The area is fast becoming an IT hub with many BPOs opening their facilities here thus creating various business opportunities for the inhabitants. All the well-known shopping centers like D-Mart, Croma and Hyper City are within your reach. The Aksa, Erangal and Marve are famous beaches located in the vicinity which is easily accessible via well-planned roads. Other water fronts in this area are Dana Paani, Madh Island & Fort, Manori Beach, Kileshwar Fort and Marve Beach which has a ferry Service to Manori from Malad.\n\nGrace Group of Companies is a reputed Real Estate firm in India with considerable experience in creating real estate projects of high net worth. Over its lifetime of construction activity, Grace Group has built a commendable army of architects, engineers and building staffs who can put into action any complex Real Estate project with ease.\n\n**For more information about floor plans, brochures, payment plans, resale options, and apartments for investors, please contact us**\n\nType, Area & Price\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | 672 Sq.ft Carpet Area | On Request |\n| 3 BHK | 886 Sq.ft Carpet Area | On Request |\n\n**Note:** Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. **\\*Rates are indicative.**\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n\\* Lift(s)  \n\\* 24/7 Water Supply  \n\\* Fire Fighting Systems  \n\\* Car Parking\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n\\* Fire Fight Equipments   \n\\* Copper Wiring Concealed   \n\\* Plumbing & Ot